{"id": "omnie-exit-code-timeout", "tags": ["omnie", "code-reading", "typescript"], "system": "Answer with the number only.", "prompt": "From omnie-cli (TypeScript):\n\n```ts\nexport type RunnerErrorCode =\n  | \"bad-url\"\n  | \"unauthorized\"\n  | \"not-found\"\n  | \"http\"\n  | \"invalid-response\"\n  | \"network\"\n  | \"timeout\";\n\nexport class RunnerError extends Error {\n  readonly code: RunnerErrorCode;\n  readonly status?: number;\n\n  constructor(code: RunnerErrorCode, message: string, status?: number) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = \"RunnerError\";\n    this.code = code;\n    this.status = status;\n  }\n}\n\nexport function exitCodeForError(error: unknown): number {\n  if (error instanceof UsageError || error instanceof ConfigError) return 3;\n  if (error instanceof RunnerError && (error.code === \"timeout\" || error.code === \"invalid-response\")) {\n    return error.code === \"timeout\" ? 2 : 4;\n  }\n  if (error instanceof RunnerError) return 4;\n  return 4;\n}\n```\n\nWhat exit code does `exitCodeForError(new RunnerError(\"timeout\", \"no answer in 30 s\"))` return?", "checks": [{"type": "regex", "pattern": "^[`*]*2[`*]*\\.?$"}], "max_tokens": 500}
{"id": "omnie-redact", "tags": ["omnie", "code-reading", "typescript"], "system": "Answer with the result only, no explanation.", "prompt": "From omnie-cli (TypeScript):\n\n```ts\nconst BEARER = /Bearer\\s+\\S+/gi;\nconst SECRET_KEY = /\\bsk-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,}\\b/g;\n\nexport function redactSecrets(text: string, secrets: readonly string[] = []): string {\n  let out = text;\n  for (const secret of secrets) {\n    if (secret.length < 4) continue;\n    out = out.split(secret).join(\"[redacted]\");\n  }\n  return out.replace(BEARER, \"Bearer [redacted]\").replace(SECRET_KEY, \"[redacted]\");\n}\n```\n\nWhat does `redactSecrets(\"Authorization: Bearer abc123 key=sk-abcdefgh12 pin=4821\", [\"4821\"])` return? Answer with the string only, without quotes.", "checks": [{"type": "regex", "pattern": "^[\\\"`]?Authorization: Bearer \\[redacted\\] key=\\[redacted\\] pin=\\[redacted\\][\\\"`]?\\.?$"}], "max_tokens": 800}
